---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms"
  description="Starter terms for the Herb-All catalogue and knowledge hub."
>
  <header class="container page-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">Herb-All · Good to know</p>
    <h1>Terms</h1>
  </header>
  <section class="container">
    <div class="prose">
      <p class="sample-note">
        Starter copy requiring owner and legal review before commercial launch.
        Not a jurisdiction-specific legal document.
      </p>
      <h2>Using Herb-All</h2>
      <p>
        This website provides a botanical catalogue and general educational
        information. It is not a medical service.
      </p>
      <h2>Catalogue and enquiries</h2>
      <p>
        The initial entries are sample catalogue copy, not confirmed stock
        listings. Images are illustrative placeholders. Confirm ingredients,
        packaging, price, availability and delivery directly before ordering. An
        enquiry does not create or confirm an order.
      </p>
      <h2>Growing information</h2>
      <p>
        Plant performance varies with cultivar, soil, weather and management.
        General information is not a yield or maturity guarantee.
      </p>
      <h2>Health information</h2>
      <p>
        Read the <a href="/disclaimer/">health information policy</a>. Do not
        change prescribed care based on this website.
      </p>
      <h2>Before commercial launch</h2>
      <p>
        The owner must verify business information and review consumer rights,
        ordering, refunds, delivery, complaints, copyright and local legal
        requirements.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
